			<p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.40;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align:left;margin-bottom:0"><a href="/objectlessons/daniel-lesson-5.pdf">The Writing on the Wall</a></p>
			<p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.40;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align:left;margin-bottom:0"><a href="/objectlessons/daniel-lesson-4b.pdf">Pride vs Humility</a></p>
