			<p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.40;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align:left;margin-bottom:0"><a href="/objectlessons/Greek-to-Me.pdf">It's All Greek to Me</a><br /><a href="/objectlessons/God-Keeps-His-Promises.pdf">God Keeps His Promises</a><br /><a href="/objectlessons/pearl_of_great_price.pdf">The Pearl of Great Price</a><br /><a href="/objectlessons/The_Bible_Is_a_Mirror.pdf">The Bible is a Mirror</a><br /><a href="/objectlessons/prayer-moving-mountains.pdf">Prayer Moving Mountains</a><br /><a href="/objectlessons/Junk-Mail-Wisdom.pdf">Wisdom Junk Mail</a></p>
			<p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.40;color:rgb(0, 0, 0);text-align:left;margin-bottom:0"><a href="/objectlessons/Make-Time-for-God.pdf"><strong>Make Time for God</strong></a><br /><a href="/objectlessons/Sticking-to-God-Lesson-Plan.pdf">Sticking to God</a><br /><a href="/objectlessons/Log-in-your-Eye.pdf">Log in your Eye</a><br /><a href="/objectlessons/Boo-Sin-Yay-Forgiveness.pdf">Boo Sin Yay Forgiveness</a><br /><a href="/objectlessons/Power-of-God.pdf">The Power of God</a><br /><a href="/objectlessons/Are-You-a-Grape.pdf">Are You a Grape or a Raisin?</a><br /><a href="/objectlessons/The-Burden-of-Sin.pdf">The Burden of Sin</a><br /><a href="/objectlessons/jonahandthebigfish.pdf">Jonah</a><br /><a href="/objectlessons/jesusheals.pdf">Jesus Heals</a><br /><a href="/objectlessons/idolatryanuttylesson.pdf">Idolatry</a><br /><a href="/objectlessons/prayerobjectlesson.pdf">Prayer</a><br /><a href="/objectlessons/howtogrowinchrist.pdf">How to Grow in Christ</a><br /><a href="/objectlessons/learningthebible.pdf">Learning the Bible</a><br /><a href="/objectlessons/spinningthroughlife.pdf">Spinning Through Life</a><br /><a href="/objectlessons/driversseat.pdf">Jesus in the Driver's Seat</a><br /><a href="/objectlessons/fallingshort.pdf">Falling Short</a><br /><a href="/objectlessons/thebalancedlife.pdf">The Balanced Life</a><br /><a href="/objectlessons/potatomaskscolor.pdf">Potatoes Who Love the Lord (color)</a><br /><a href="/objectlessons/potatomasksbw.pdf">Potatoes Who Love the Lord (B&amp;W)</a><br /><a href="/objectlessons/tangledupinsin.pdf">Tangled Up in Sin</a><br /><a href="/objectlessons/takeoutthetrash.pdf">Purity</a><br /><a href="/objectlessons/thebodyofdeath.pdf">The Body of Death</a><br /><a href="/objectlessons/thestickytrapofsin.pdf">The Sticky Trap</a><br /><a href="/objectlessons/spreadofthegospel.pdf">The Spread of the Gospel (Lesson)</a><br /><a href="/objectlessons/gospelmap.pdf">The Spread of the Gospel (map)</a><br /><a href="/objectlessons